data: {"id": "0aca16333ecd4560-final", "run_id": "0aca16333ecd4560", "seq": 7675, "ts_ms": 1788439941204, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c` | CrashLoopBackOff | Pod aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c处于CrashLoopBackOff状态，容器反复以exitCode=2退出。 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | container.last_terminated_reason: Error; container.waiting_reason: CrashLoopBackOff; container.last_exit_code: 2 | 确认容器因应用层错误退出并陷入重启循环 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | Back-off restarting failed container app in pod workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c_aiops-case-06(x2246 over 54m) | 证实故障已持续超过 54 分钟，呈现长期不可用状态 |\n| 3 | Logging | elasticsearch | pattern: 'http_request' level=error, message='runtime process exiting', http_status=500, path='/work', service='aiops-lab-workload' (occurrence_count: 5) | 显示应用在处理 /work 请求时返回 500 并主动终止进程，直接触发 Exit Code 2 |\n| 4 | Logging | elasticsearch | pattern: 'http_request' level=info, message='request completed', http_status=200, path='/work' (occurrence_count: 3) | 证实故障是间歇性的（非全量失败），属于应用层面的逻辑或资源异常 |\n| 5 | Tracing | deepflow | flow: GET /work response_code=500 (occurrence_count: 3, trace_ids: 5ece3a3567c00350affa4aa671974916, a20983a0df407fabfebf02a857a821f0, 00775f8b4349217aaa79618a772f0c9f) | 确认 L7 网络层记录到 500 状态码，且 trace_id 与日志中的错误模式匹配 |\n| 6 | Tracing | deepflow | flow: GET /work response_code=200 (occurrence_count: 6, trace_ids: faf9cab3241d28fa6fb3be64fa088632, 97a75c073642b491e78d960ba0ad27a4, b108f94420f321786f588771ea8c124d, dd9d5506e571f94d00a178756bbf164d, 1dd0390e01743daee89421c7f5eee5fc) | 确认流量在正常路径下能成功返回 200，排除网络层拦截或路由配置错误 |\n\n**证据综合分析：**\nKubernetes 层面（#1, #2）显示容器因非零退出码反复重启，处于 CrashLoopBackOff 状态。Logging（#3）与 Tracing（#5）在相同的 `/work` 接口路径上交叉印证了 500 错误和进程退出现象。Tracing 中成功返回 200 的记录（#6）与部分成功的日志（#4）共同证实了该故障为应用内部处理逻辑的间歇性失败，而非基础设施或网络层的硬性阻断。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n应用处理 /work 接口发生内部异常（未体现具体类型） → 返回 HTTP 500 并调用进程退出 → Exit Code 2 触发 K8s 重启策略 → CrashLoopBackOff\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因：**应用业务逻辑异常导致请求失败并主动退出。**\n应用在处理 HTTP 请求 `GET /work` 时发生未捕获的运行时错误，导致进程主动终止（`exitCode=2`），Kubernetes 随后将其重启并触发 `CrashLoopBackOff`（证据 #1, #3, #6）。\n\n**证据不足说明：**\n导致 `/work` 返回 500 的具体异常类型（如内存溢出、空指针或第三方依赖故障）在日志和 Trace 中均未体现，无法进一步定位至具体的代码行或底层原因。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 3.7m\n├─ 问题定位: 35.9s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 171.8s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c: 171.8s (Evidence 159.1s, RCA 12.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 14.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-06/workload-7679bcf76-w9s9c**: pod-crashloop-runtime\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 222.424, "metrics": {"run_id": "0aca16333ecd4560", "mttr": {"value": "3.7m", "seconds": 222.42967200279236, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "50%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-crashloop-runtime", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-crashloop-runtime"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.9, "weighted_score": 0.18, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 90%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 222429.67200279236, "llm_calls": 18, "llm_duration_ms": 197350.42357444763, "tool_calls": 27, "executed_tool_calls": 23, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 4, "successful_tool_calls": 24, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 43361.62257194519, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 24315.547704696655}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 35937.53981590271, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 171788.03515434265, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 14464.678287506104, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

